    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing 1 the Connons, a neat four bedroom semi-detached house in turn key condition with all mod cons just five minutes from Clones town.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway with under stairs storage, downstairs w.c., spacious kitchen/dining area, utility room and sitting room with solid fuel stove.  First floor comprises of four bedrooms, one of the bedrooms which has an en-suite and a family bathroom. Outside, the property has mature and well maintained gardens to the front and rear of the property with a garden shed. The subject property is located 100 metres from the Church and school. \r\n\r\nThere is also space for off street parking for two cars. this property is the ideal opportunity for any first time buyer or investor.\r\n\r\nMore about the location... The property is just a 10 minute drive from Belturbet and a 15-20 minute drive from Cavan. Both Cavan and Monaghan offers a host of employment opportunities along with schools and institutes for further education. Both offer a host of bars, restaurants and shops. There also local transport links available."
      },
